{"id":28076,"author":"Vior_","body":"\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700;\"\u003eCriteria:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0pt 0px 0pt 25px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003eMust have at least three days of play time.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003eMust be applying for a moderator position.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003eMust not be banned on any Avicus platform.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003eMust speak fluent English\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003eMust be active on all Avicus platforms (in-game, Teamspeak, Forums and Discord)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700;\"\u003eAge: 13\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700;\"\u003eTimezone: ET\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700;\"\u003eDo you have Teamspeak? Yes\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700;\"\u003eDo you have Discord? Yes\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700;\"\u003eDo you have access to a recording software? Yes\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; font-weight: 700;\"\u003eCRITERIA 1: SELF REFLECTION/EVALUATION\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eDo you have any experience as a moderator on other servers?\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eNo\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eWhat is your biggest weakness and how will it affect your moderating?\u003cu\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eSchool but I will be active enough.\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Arial;\"\u003eWhat qualities do you think a leader must have? Would you consider yourself a leader?\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Arial\"\u003eWhy/why not?\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Arial\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eI think a leader has to have focus and Confidence that he/she is doing whats right. I\u0026nbsp;would consider myself a leader because I have\u0026nbsp;qualities that other mods have that are used to manage avicus.\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Arial\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eWhat attributes distinguish yourself from other players that qualify you to be a moderator?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Arial\"\u003eI am loyal and\u0026nbsp;Righteous. I know what is acceptable on the\u0026nbsp;server because I have been on it quite some time.\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eWhat skills do you believe you should have when interacting with the community? Do you believe you have these skills?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cu style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial;\"\u003eI think the most important skill is being nice and true to your job (not abusing powers). If you are disrespectful to the\u0026nbsp;\u003c/u\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Arial\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eavicus members you will not be liked and not be fun to be around. The staff team should like\u0026nbsp;each other and if you mean that will most\u0026nbsp;likely not be the case. And if you abuse your powers\u0026nbsp;there\u0026nbsp;isn't any reason you should be a mod because you\u0026nbsp;aren't doing your job.\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eWhat in your opinion are the three main character traits a moderator must have when moderating?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Arial;\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eIn my opinion the three main character traits a moderator must have when moderating are\u0026nbsp;\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Arial\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eAbility to do his/her job, ability to communicate to other members and staff, and to take pride and be happy about what they do.\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; font-weight: 700;\"\u003eCRITERIA 2: GENERAL SITUATIONS\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eYou notice a moderator giving out a lot of false bans. They almost always have insufficient evidence or sometimes no evidence and they don’t seem to care. You notice it but other staff members don’t. What would you do?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Arial\"\u003eI\u0026nbsp;would talk to the rest of the\u0026nbsp;staff team and tell them what I see. We will discuss what we think we should do and I would talk to the staff that is giving out the false bans\u0026nbsp;and tell him to stop what he is doing because we know about it.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/u\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eYou are in Teamspeak with a few other players and they begin talking quite disrespectfully about a particular staff member. You agree with what they’re saying to an extent, but the conversation starts to become racial and very disrespectful soon after. You are all in a nightclub channel where this is allowed. What would you do?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003eI would tell them to stop talking about the staff member because they are being disrespectful. They should keep their opinions to\u0026nbsp;themselves even if they strong think so.\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/u\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eYou are in an Avicus team. One of your teammates is also an Avicus Staff member. One day in your team discord the team member/staff member posts a screenshot of a thread that only staff members can see.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eThe content in the screenshot isn’t very important/confidential but only staff members could see it on the forums. If anything\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003ewould you do?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Arial\"\u003eI would report them to an Admin because Seniors and other staff\u0026nbsp;aren't supposed to leak any information.w\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/u\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e\u003c/u\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eSome senior staff members are in teamspeak joking around with each other. They are removing others ranks, creating certain channels and even harassing certain users. They don’t mean any harm but some players in the channel feel a bit angry that they are using their permissions the way they are. What would you do?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Arial\"\u003eI would first tell them to stop what they are doing, it\u0026nbsp;isn't what a mod should be acting like. If they\u0026nbsp;didn't stop I would report them to a\u0026nbsp;Admin through\u0026nbsp;team speak\u0026nbsp;or discord and tell them what they are doing so they can be dealt with.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/u\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; font-weight: 700;\"\u003eCRITERIA 3: OTHER\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; text-decoration: underline;\"\u003eNOTE: This is a new criteria and these questions are less to do with right/wrong answer and more to do with us getting to know you. Please answer these honestly. There is no right or wrong answer.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eWhy do you want to be a moderator?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Arial\"\u003eI have been on this server for over 3 years and I want to be apart\u0026nbsp;of a bigger better community inside itself.\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/u\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eWhat does Avicus mean to you?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Arial\"\u003eAvicus is the best\u0026nbsp;Minecraft\u0026nbsp;server I have ever played. I have\u0026nbsp;spent forever on it coming home and hopping on the computer. I\u0026nbsp;don't know what I would do without it because it is such a big part of my life.\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/u\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eAnything specific the staff team could do better?\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eI think that the staff team needs to pay attention to the chat better because I see a lot of directed profanity, racism, and homosexual slurs that have nothing done about them.\u003c/u\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eWhy did you choose to apply at Avicus?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003eI think that they have a great team and I am on the server so often. I think it would\u0026nbsp;be a great\u0026nbsp;opportunity for me to show who I am as an\u0026nbsp;avicus member.\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/u\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eDo you have anything else to add to your application?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eThank you.\u003c/u\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e","body_tagged":"\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700;\"\u003eCriteria:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0pt 0px 0pt 25px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003eMust have at least three days of play time.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003eMust be applying for a moderator position.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003eMust not be banned on any Avicus platform.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003eMust speak fluent English\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003eMust be active on all Avicus platforms (in-game, Teamspeak, Forums and Discord)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700;\"\u003eAge: 13\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700;\"\u003eTimezone: ET\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700;\"\u003eDo you have Teamspeak? Yes\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700;\"\u003eDo you have Discord? Yes\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700;\"\u003eDo you have access to a recording software? Yes\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; font-weight: 700;\"\u003eCRITERIA 1: SELF REFLECTION/EVALUATION\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eDo you have any experience as a moderator on other servers?\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eNo\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eWhat is your biggest weakness and how will it affect your moderating?\u003cu\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eSchool but I will be active enough.\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Arial;\"\u003eWhat qualities do you think a leader must have? Would you consider yourself a leader?\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Arial\"\u003eWhy/why not?\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Arial\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eI think a leader has to have focus and Confidence that he/she is doing whats right. I\u0026nbsp;would consider myself a leader because I have\u0026nbsp;qualities that other mods have that are used to manage avicus.\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Arial\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eWhat attributes distinguish yourself from other players that qualify you to be a moderator?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Arial\"\u003eI am loyal and\u0026nbsp;Righteous. I know what is acceptable on the\u0026nbsp;server because I have been on it quite some time.\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eWhat skills do you believe you should have when interacting with the community? Do you believe you have these skills?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cu style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial;\"\u003eI think the most important skill is being nice and true to your job (not abusing powers). If you are disrespectful to the\u0026nbsp;\u003c/u\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Arial\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eavicus members you will not be liked and not be fun to be around. The staff team should like\u0026nbsp;each other and if you mean that will most\u0026nbsp;likely not be the case. And if you abuse your powers\u0026nbsp;there\u0026nbsp;isn't any reason you should be a mod because you\u0026nbsp;aren't doing your job.\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eWhat in your opinion are the three main character traits a moderator must have when moderating?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Arial;\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eIn my opinion the three main character traits a moderator must have when moderating are\u0026nbsp;\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Arial\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eAbility to do his/her job, ability to communicate to other members and staff, and to take pride and be happy about what they do.\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; font-weight: 700;\"\u003eCRITERIA 2: GENERAL SITUATIONS\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eYou notice a moderator giving out a lot of false bans. They almost always have insufficient evidence or sometimes no evidence and they don’t seem to care. You notice it but other staff members don’t. What would you do?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Arial\"\u003eI\u0026nbsp;would talk to the rest of the\u0026nbsp;staff team and tell them what I see. We will discuss what we think we should do and I would talk to the staff that is giving out the false bans\u0026nbsp;and tell him to stop what he is doing because we know about it.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/u\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eYou are in Teamspeak with a few other players and they begin talking quite disrespectfully about a particular staff member. You agree with what they’re saying to an extent, but the conversation starts to become racial and very disrespectful soon after. You are all in a nightclub channel where this is allowed. What would you do?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003eI would tell them to stop talking about the staff member because they are being disrespectful. They should keep their opinions to\u0026nbsp;themselves even if they strong think so.\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/u\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eYou are in an Avicus team. One of your teammates is also an Avicus Staff member. One day in your team discord the team member/staff member posts a screenshot of a thread that only staff members can see.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eThe content in the screenshot isn’t very important/confidential but only staff members could see it on the forums. If anything\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003ewould you do?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Arial\"\u003eI would report them to an Admin because Seniors and other staff\u0026nbsp;aren't supposed to leak any information.w\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/u\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e\u003c/u\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eSome senior staff members are in teamspeak joking around with each other. They are removing others ranks, creating certain channels and even harassing certain users. They don’t mean any harm but some players in the channel feel a bit angry that they are using their permissions the way they are. What would you do?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Arial\"\u003eI would first tell them to stop what they are doing, it\u0026nbsp;isn't what a mod should be acting like. If they\u0026nbsp;didn't stop I would report them to a\u0026nbsp;Admin through\u0026nbsp;team speak\u0026nbsp;or discord and tell them what they are doing so they can be dealt with.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/u\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; font-weight: 700;\"\u003eCRITERIA 3: OTHER\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; text-decoration: underline;\"\u003eNOTE: This is a new criteria and these questions are less to do with right/wrong answer and more to do with us getting to know you. Please answer these honestly. There is no right or wrong answer.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eWhy do you want to be a moderator?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Arial\"\u003eI have been on this server for over 3 years and I want to be apart\u0026nbsp;of a bigger better community inside itself.\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/u\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eWhat does Avicus mean to you?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Arial\"\u003eAvicus is the best\u0026nbsp;Minecraft\u0026nbsp;server I have ever played. I have\u0026nbsp;spent forever on it coming home and hopping on the computer. I\u0026nbsp;don't know what I would do without it because it is such a big part of my life.\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/u\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eAnything specific the staff team could do better?\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eI think that the staff team needs to pay attention to the chat better because I see a lot of directed profanity, racism, and homosexual slurs that have nothing done about them.\u003c/u\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eWhy did you choose to apply at Avicus?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003eI think that they have a great team and I am on the server so often. I think it would\u0026nbsp;be a great\u0026nbsp;opportunity for me to show who I am as an\u0026nbsp;avicus member.\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/u\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eDo you have anything else to add to your application?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eThank you.\u003c/u\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e","created_at":1502372651,"title":"Vior Staff application august 2017","replies":[{"id":378664,"author":"BoldAndBrash","body":"\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; font-family: Arial; font-weight: 700;\"\u003e[Reviewing]\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; font-family: Arial;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;- Your application has been tagged reviewing and will remain like this until at least 4 other Senior Staff \u0026amp; Mentors read over your application and vote.\u003c/span\u003e","body_tagged":"\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; font-family: Arial; font-weight: 700;\"\u003e[Reviewing]\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; font-family: Arial;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;- Your application has been tagged reviewing and will remain like this until at least 4 other Senior Staff \u0026amp; Mentors read over your application and vote.\u003c/span\u003e","created_at":1502381257},{"id":379093,"author":"BoldAndBrash","body":"\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px 9pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; font-weight: 700;\"\u003e[Denied]\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003e- I am sorry to say your application has been denied for:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px 9pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\"\u003e- Lack of community interaction\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px 9pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eYou may not submit\u003c/span\u003e\u003cb style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003eanother\u003cb style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003eapplication. Thanks for applying!\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","body_tagged":"\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px 9pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial; font-weight: 700;\"\u003e[Denied]\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Arial;\"\u003e- I am sorry to say your application has been denied for:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px 9pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\"\u003e- Lack of community interaction\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px 9pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\"\u003e\u003cspan 